!
! This test calculates the dipole polarizability
| of the water molecule at various frequencies
| using the linear response module.
!
**DIRAC
.WAVE FUNCTION
.PROPERTIES
**HAMILTONIAN
.BSS
 999
.CMPEIG
.PRINT
 2
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACT
**WAVE FUNCTION
.DHF
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
 10
.EVCCNV
 1.0D-4         !we use poor convergence threshold for the test
**PROPERTIES
.POLARIZABILITY
*LINEAR RESPONSE
.SKIPEP
.THRESH
 1.0D-3         !we use poor convergence threshold for the test
.MAXRED
 400
.B FREQ
 3
 0.00
 0.10
 0.20
*END OF


    *************************************************************************
    ********************* DIRAC: No title specified !!! *********************
    *************************************************************************

